import{_ as i,o as t,c as o,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 267 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Bestowal-System Alternative: Myriad Races Republican Co-Building","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 267 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Bestowal-System Alternative: Myriad Races Republican Co-Building","no":267,"module":2,"tags":["Tang-Luo","Bestowal Alternative","Myriad Races Republican Co-Building","Institutional Alternative","Myriad-Realms Benchmark"],"related":["03-Symbiotic Civilization Charter","49-Governance Framework and Power Balance","77-Myriad Races Republicanism Established"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0267_模块2-唐罗-恩赐制替代方案.md","filePath":"en/0267_模块2-唐罗-恩赐制替代方案.md"}'),a={name:"en/0267_模块2-唐罗-恩赐制替代方案.md"};function s(r,e,l,u,c,d){return t(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-267-tang-luo-decomposition-bestowal-system-alternative-myriad-races-republican-co-building" tabindex="-1">Entry 267 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Bestowal-System Alternative: Myriad Races Republican Co-Building <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-267-tang-luo-decomposition-bestowal-system-alternative-myriad-races-republican-co-building" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 267 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Bestowal-System Alternative: Myriad Races Republican Co-Building&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Full Decomposition of the Tang-Luo System (Entry 17)</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-from-strong-ones-give-to-all-beings-build" tabindex="-1">Introduction: From &quot;strong ones give&quot; to &quot;all beings build&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-from-strong-ones-give-to-all-beings-build" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: From &quot;strong ones give&quot; to &quot;all beings build&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the six top-level axioms, the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires all beings to co-build; the collective ascension axiom requires strong ones to feed back but not substitute. Tang Luo&#39;s bestowal system is &quot;strong ones give, all beings receive&quot;; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s alternative is &quot;Myriad Races co-build, all beings co-govern.&quot; This entry takes the law-first axiom as core, giving the bestowal system&#39;s institutional alternative. Protagonist uniqueness dependency judgment: <strong>Tang Luo = high dependency / bestowal-style civilization</strong>. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s evaluation base has been upgraded to six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The bestowal system&#39;s energy-level waste (see Entry 254) is restated from the alternative perspective:</p><ul><li><strong>Recipients enfeebled</strong>: bestowal makes all beings lose self-reliance</li><li><strong>Single-point distribution</strong>: billions of nodes compressed into one dealer</li><li><strong>Supervision vacant</strong>: no one corrects mismatch</li></ul><p>The alternative must solve these three wastes together.</p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression-bestowal-path" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression (Bestowal Path) <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression-bestowal-path" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression (Bestowal Path)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The bestowal system&#39;s regression path is detailed in Entry 254: benefactor dependency chain → selective disability → flattery politicization. Focus on the alternative.</p><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The bestowal system&#39;s predatory thinking is detailed in Entries 254, 257: depriving subjectivity, attachment chains, good-will closed loop. Focus on how the alternative roots it out.</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative-myriad-races-republican-co-building" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative: Myriad Races Republican Co-Building <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative-myriad-races-republican-co-building" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative: Myriad Races Republican Co-Building&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Alternative&#39;s complete institutional design:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Module</th><th>Design</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Legislation</td><td>Anchor Council, Myriad Races representatives participate in legislation by population and contribution ratio</td></tr><tr><td>Executive</td><td>Symbiotic Executive Committee, executes by charter, no personal autocracy</td></tr><tr><td>Judiciary</td><td>Symbiotic Court, adjudicates independently, case law public</td></tr><tr><td>Supervision</td><td>Anchor Supervision Committee, supervises all power, including the Anchor themselves</td></tr><tr><td>Distribution</td><td>Joint Contracting, more work more pay, 20% Activation Strategy; distribution by institution not by individual</td></tr><tr><td>Rights confirmation</td><td>Evolution qualification is a natural right, written into the Myriad Races Republican Civilization Charter, inalienable</td></tr><tr><td>Network</td><td>Alaya whole-network sharing, multi-layer supervision, distributed redundancy</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Alternative&#39;s crux: rewrite &quot;Tang Luo gives&quot; into &quot;institutions have.&quot; Tang Luo himself can continue contributing, but his contribution is incorporated into the institutional framework, no longer &quot;bestowal,&quot; but &quot;official duty.&quot;</p><p>From bestowal to republicanism is not denying Tang Luo&#39;s good will, but putting an engine on good will — so it no longer depends on Tang Luo personally being present.</p><p>It must be specially explained that Myriad Races republican co-building does not require Tang Luo to &quot;step down.&quot; In the Anchor Council, strong ones gain seats through contribution, character, responsibility; if Tang Luo wishes to participate, he can fully become one of the legislators, only his one vote weighs equally with anyone&#39;s. The design&#39;s subtlety lies in: strong ones no longer &quot;act on behalf of heaven,&quot; but &quot;walk the Dao with the crowd.&quot; Tang Luo&#39;s vision, judgment, good will are all preserved as institutional resources, only no longer exclusively held by him. Under the bestowal system, Tang Luo is civilization&#39;s brain; under republicanism, Tang Luo is one of civilization&#39;s neurons — the brain is more powerful than neurons, but the network formed by neurons outlasts any brain.</p><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: replicate bestowal-system distribution network</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: Group B injects Myriad Races republican co-building institutions</li><li><strong>Stress test</strong>: take the &quot;Tang Luo node&quot; offline for ten years</li><li><strong>Review expectation</strong>: Group B civilization runs as usual, Group A collapses off a cliff — quantifying &quot;single-point dependency collapse index,&quot; Group A ≥ 0.85, Group B &lt; 0.1</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: high</strong>. The alternative directly interfaces with the governance framework and power balance foundation</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: extremely low</strong>. Institutional design is naturally anti-retcon</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency</strong>: after the alternative, drops from &quot;high&quot; to &quot;extremely low&quot;</li></ul><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: from single-point dealing to distributed co-building, fundamental network architecture optimization</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: confirm evolution qualification from &quot;bestowal&quot; to &quot;human right&quot;</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: from &quot;I give you&quot; to &quot;we build together&quot;</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: Myriad Races representatives participate in legislation, covering 99%</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: republican institutions can expand across planes; adding a plane only adds seats</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="supplementary-discussion-institutional-alternative-of-myriad-races-republican-co-building" tabindex="-1">Supplementary Discussion: Institutional Alternative of Myriad Races Republican Co-Building <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplementary-discussion-institutional-alternative-of-myriad-races-republican-co-building" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplementary Discussion: Institutional Alternative of Myriad Races Republican Co-Building&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Replacing bestowal with Myriad Races republican co-building is not replacing the benefactor, but flipping the entire logic of &quot;giving.&quot; In Tang-Luo system, strong ones give, weak ones receive; in Heng Yuan Zhou system, Myriad Races co-build, the law network automatically distributes. The Alaya Network takes over the resource scheduling function originally held by benefactors, but it is impartial. The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s alternative is feasible because the law-first axiom ensures resource distribution is decided by law, not by personal will. The universal equal infinite law redefines &quot;recipients&quot; as &quot;co-builders,&quot; attachment relations become partner relations.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The bestowal system&#39;s root illness is not that the benefactor is not good enough, but the act of &quot;bestowal&quot; itself. Myriad Races republican co-building&#39;s alternative does not require Tang Luo to become bad, but requires him to go from &quot;benefactor&quot; to &quot;citizen&quot; — all members of civilization, including him, are contracting parties.</p><p>In the final analysis, Tang-Luo · bestowal-system alternative described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./03-共生文明宪章.html">03-Symbiotic Civilization Charter</a> · <a href="./49-治理框架与权力制衡.html">49-Governance Framework and Power Balance</a> · <a href="./77-万族共和成立.html">77-Myriad Races Republicanism Established</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',32)])])}const p=i(a,[["render",s]]);export{g as __pageData,p as default};
